Module: Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith.Preprocessing
Name: Linarith.defaultPreprocessors
Description: The default list of global branching preprocessors for the `linarith` tactic, in the order they should typically be applied. These preprocessors include:
1. Filtering to retain only comparison proofs (inequalities and equalities)
2. Removing negations by converting negated comparisons to reversed comparisons
3. Lifting natural number comparisons to integers and adding nonnegativity proofs
4. Strengthening strict integer inequalities to non-strict inequalities
