\tag{10}
\]

--------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2.  From the description of \(f\) to the functional equation

Assume the right‑hand side of the theorem:

\[
\forall z,\;f(z)=0\;\lor\;\exists c,\;\forall z,\;f(z)=2z+c .   \tag{R}
\]

We must verify (1).

